{"slug":"UPD-SCP-retroBreach-Aimbot-and-ESP-and-escape-tp-123522","_id":"69a1f5090fe40e027d4a2828","title":"Aimbot and ESP and escape tp","game":{"_id":"6953910e426a0c4abc040dd6","gameId":113217312262185,"name":"[2X💰] SCP retroBreach","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-39007a745acaa4f7dc6f1a5ac8fbf531-71db74471b0e.png","placeId":113217312262185},"features":"👑 Emperor HUB\n\nhey! i made this script for SCP retroBreach, been working on it for a while. figured i'd share it with yall\n\n🔑 key\n\nIamthragg (case sensitive)\n\n🎯 what it does\n\naimbot\n\n· toggle on/off\n· fov circle so u can see the range\n· smoothness slider (make it snappy or smooth)\n· wall check - wont aim thru walls if u dont want it to\n· team check - dont shoot ur own guys (or turn it off and go crazy)\n\nesp\n\n· names above players with their team\n· health % so u know who's low\n· distance so u know how far\n· CHAMS (wallhack) - see ppl thru walls, they glow their team color\n\nteam colors\n\n· scp = red\n· class-d = yellow\n· security/mtf = blue\n· chaos = green\n· serpents hand = pink\n· foundation = light blue\n· goc = cyan\n\nteleports\n\n· 9 map locations (escape, nuke, gate a, etc)\n· tp to any player\n· tp where ur mouse is looking\n· set ur own keybind (default is T)\n\nother\n\n· speed boost (u can adjust how fast)\n· press K to hide/show menu\n\nworks on pc and mobile (arceus x etc). only for scp retrobreach tho\n\nif u find bugs lmk ok? Still updating","tags":["scp","Scp Retrobreach","Aimbot","Esp","Toggle"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://api.jnkie.com/api/v1/luascripts/public/8e8de3e74cd63d97eafab155bec6e78c0f8995252bb3a6515a36fc2460c08985/download\"))()","owner":{"_id":"666254dbf1eeae26efb2b395","username":"madnessahmed5","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"666254dbf1eeae26efb2b395","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/xnnpMQdVv","views":3498,"scriptType":"free"